# ots upgrade writes a .bak beside the proof — an artifact, not a record
*.ots.bak

# Internal working notes, unpublished by design.
# Both files are titled "synapse (on the fabius rules) -> ... roadmap" and describe a
# SEPARATE project's worker internals, commit SHAs, env-var names and file paths.
# fabius is a plugin, not a platform: no fabius surface links to or describes synapse.
# They were tracked in the public repo until 2026-08-26. Neither is in the 18-file
# content seal, neither is referenced by README/ARCHITECTURE/AGENTS/CORPUS or any gate,
# so removing them changes no shipped contract. They remain on disk for the owner.
FRONTIER-ROADMAP.md
VOICE-ROADMAP.md
